      "writtenOn": "2018-07-17T17:07:56Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "As per datasheet of ITE83xx, RESET_FLAG_POWER_ON means VSTBY power up reset.\nThis flag doesn\u0027t necessary mean loss of VBAT rail(which power BRAM in absence of VSTBY)\n\nI probed VBAT, \u0026 it is stable when cold reset was asserted(dut-control cold_reset:on sleep :0.5 cold_reset:on)\n\nI did quick scan on datasheet for register which indicate VBAT rail power loss but couldn\u0027t find one.",
      "parentUuid": "65fc2bdb_3027fc2e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 65,
        "endChar": 34
